                {% endfor %}
            </table>
        </div>
        </p>
<p class="premark">注：feature为特征类型 ；control_num：该区域control组中DMP个数；Heterogeneously_Methylated：该区域中部分甲基化DMP个数；Hypermethylated：该区域高甲基化DMP个数；Hypomethylated：该区域中低甲基化DMP个数。</p>
    <p class="premark">结果文件路径：见Result目录下2.DMP/*vs*/DMP_*_Statistics.csv文件。</p>
